DTSTAMP:20260710T101045Z
DTSTART:20260611T160000Z
DTEND:20260718T230000Z
SUMMARY:Solitaire Fan Zone – FIFA World Cup 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Solitaire Fan Zone brings football fans together for an immersive FIFA World Cup 2026 viewing experience\, featuring live match screenings in a stadium-inspired atmosphere. Visitors can enjoy a variety of entertainment activities\, interactive challenges\, and experiences throughout the tournament. The fan zone also features a diverse selection of brands across food and beverages\, perfumes\, fashion\, and gaming\, creating a vibrant destination for football enthusiasts\, friends\, and families alike. Book Now
LOCATION:Solitaire Mall\, Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-solitaire-fan-zone-fifa-world-cup-2026.html
END:VEVENT
